@prefix is: <http://infiniq.co.kr/2026/industry_safety#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

###################################################
# Classes
###################################################

is:안전보건교육 a owl:Class .
is:안전보건교육이수기록 a owl:Class .
is:근로자 a owl:Class .
is:비사무직 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf is:근로자 .
is:사무직 a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:subClassOf is:근로자 .


###################################################
# Object Properties
###################################################

is:안전보건교육을이수하다 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:근로자 ;
    rdfs:range  is:안전보건교육 .

is:안전보건교육이수기록을갖다 a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:근로자 ;
    rdfs:range  is:안전보건교육이수기록 .




is:has이수일 a owl:DataProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:안전보건교육이수기록 ;
    rdfs:range  xsd:date .
is:has이수요구시간 a owl:DataProperty ;
    rdfs:domain is:근로자 ;
    rdfs:range  xsd:decimal .